<title>USA: UOL Publishing completes 1.43 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>UOL Publishing completes 1.43 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>UOL Publishing Inc said on Tuesday that it has completed its initial public offering of 1,430,000 shares of common stock, at a price of $13 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it has granted the underwriters a 30-day option to purchase up to 214,500 shares of common stock to cover over-allotments.</p>
